WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:02,280
Parents have a super room

2
00:00:02,840 --> 00:00:07,980
This guy really makes people unable to see through the boss.

3
00:00:07,980 --> 00:00:10,380
Mr. Xue just had some New Year gifts delivered to him

4
00:00:10,380 --> 00:00:11,980
He also said that I couldn’t get through to your phone number.

5
00:00:12,970 --> 00:00:14,570
You send the things back to him as they are.

6
00:00:14,570 --> 00:00:16,170
Don't say anything, just leave

7
00:00:16,170 --> 00:00:17,570
He knows what it means

8
00:00:18,170 --> 00:00:38,820
Let's have a competition to see who can build the biggest snowman.

9
00:00:38,820 --> 00:00:40,020
Just do it slowly by yourself.

10
00:00:40,020 --> 00:00:41,620
I can't bear to be moved by your father.
